<p class=3D"MsoPlainText"><font size=3D"2" face=3D"Calibri"><span style=3D"=
font-size:11.0pt">1. I don't see a strict requirement for an authenticated =
signal at the end of the handshake. No prior version of EAP-TLS needed this=
